@startuml
title Aid Request lifecycle (SRS workflow projection)
state Pending
state Verified
state Dispatched
state Delivered
state Archived
state Rejected
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Verified : Coordinator verifies / review_status=VERIFIED
Pending --> Rejected : Reject / review_status=REJECTED
Verified --> Dispatched : Related shipment IN_TRANSIT
Dispatched --> Delivered : Server accepts required handovers
Delivered --> Archived : Close case with audit entry
Archived --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
note bottom of Dispatched
AidRequest lifecycle is proposed, distinct from Shipment.status.
Local offline scan never triggers canonical Delivered before sync.
end note
@enduml
